{"id":"vod_sn_37438","vodId":"37438","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"十二国记","name_cn":"十二国记","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4d260410ff14c53e5dac49b6fa953f06.jpg"},"summary":"有着血红色头发的高中女生阳子一心想做个好学生，得到周围人的认可。然而在她平静祥和的生活背后却是深沉的压抑与掩饰，一夜夜的梦魇给她带来无尽的烦恼与痛苦。一天，一头金发的男子来到她的面前，把她带入了另一个世界，一个充满未知却仿佛故里的地方。　　那里有十二个国家，由十二只麒麟选出十二名国王。麒麟生于失身木，他们顺从天意选出具有王气的人，然后以台辅的身份辅佐国王治理国家。当国王失道的时候，麒麟就会得失道之病最终死去。带走阳子的金发男子即是庆国的麒麟，他认定阳子是王，并誓死效忠。阳子的世界发生翻天覆地的变化，历经磨难和内心的挣扎，她最终站在登基塔上接受了天赦，成为景王！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":45,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ba6ChguEt81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9FwQZsq4yX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gRkiYUy4ia1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rtMW2xX4mf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k3aiCRCjTn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vcPJ82z4Y11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4mcXL4PMrL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vgpf93L2k21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CLeJBcxqdK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cR9c6hpxCk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5jWXb8TUVg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TSD0f7atJb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HfXBE5KVxu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9ucXVW0tqc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url